    "body": "This is not a rope system and it does not add a visible rope. The lantern uses RDR2's physical attachment joint between Gun_GripR and PH_Belt_Thrower. Player collision is now enabled, and the joint is removed during falling/ragdoll/get-up, rebuilt after a 750 ms stable period, and rebuilt again after three stable forward-orientation failures. Test normal leg contact, swing, and a fall/get-up cycle.",
